by yceruto at 2026-03-29T15:51:04Z

I've added two new view vars to help building progress step bars (`is_before_current_step`, `is_after_current_step`). Example:
```twig
{% for step in form.vars.visible_steps %}
    <div class="text-center" style="min-width: 2rem">
        {% if step.is_before_current_step %}
            {# Complete step markup #}
        {% elseif step.is_current_step %}
            {# Current step markup #}
        {% elseif step.is_after_current_step %}
            {# Pending state markup #}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
{% endfor %}
```
This way, we don’t have to deal with step index comparisons, which are more complex to compute with nested steps.

